<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fastenal raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fastenal raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robert Baird &amp; Co said analyst Judy Scott raised the rating on Fastenal Co to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited stock price and belief that, under long-term growth plan, growth will accelerate to annual rate of about 40 percent.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1-1/2 to 36-1/2.</p>
</text>
